dbuftest on the A1200 + PiStorm32-lite + CM4 (Emu68 390e5b6), OS 3.9,
VideoCore.card 1.5 (23.10.2026) git:2016d83 with the monitor tooltype
INTERRUPT=NO (no vertical blank interrupt: rtg.library polls), 2026-11-17.
Command: dbuftest 50011303
Note: in this mode 60 WaitBOVP() calls in a row take 91 us (the refresh
line), so that line does not show the refresh. The reason, read from
rtg.library and the driver later (rtg-analysis notes, beamprobe.log): the
polling WaitBOVP waits for a line counter value that is held ~109 us, and
calls in a row all fall inside that window. In the single swap tables each
test starts right after the swap before it returned, i.e. at a blank, so
"ms after blank" is right there even though WaitBOVP did not do the lining
up.

